    <item>
      <title>OpenAI 硬件定名「10美分」：奥特曼想让你“舔一口”，库克却想让他“别做梦”</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/openai-10-20260209074005811-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Feb 2026 07:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
